    "description": "Zoho WorkDrive Integration for Zoho CRM seamlessly connects your CRM records with Zoho WorkDrive, automatically creating and organizing dedicated folders for Leads, Contacts, Accounts, and Deals. Each new CRM record is linked to its corresponding WorkDrive folder, with the folder ID and direct URL automatically added to the CRM record. Users can access and manage their documents directly from CRM, while WorkDrive maintains a structured and organized folder hierarchy.",
    "longDescription": "<h1>Zoho WorkDrive Integration for Zoho CRM — Long Description</h1><p><strong>Zoho WorkDrive Integration for Zoho CRM</strong> seamlessly connects your Zoho CRM records with Zoho WorkDrive, making it easier to organize, manage, and access documents associated with your customers, leads, accounts, and deals.</p><p>The extension automatically creates a dedicated WorkDrive folder whenever a new record is created in the supported Zoho CRM modules. Currently, the extension supports <strong>Leads, Contacts, Accounts, and Deals</strong>.</p><p>Once the extension is installed and authorized with Zoho WorkDrive, the required integration fields are automatically added to the supported CRM modules. When a new CRM record is created, the extension automatically creates a folder using the record's name within the appropriate module folder in Zoho WorkDrive.</p><p>For example, if you create a Lead named <strong>John Smith</strong>, the extension automatically creates a folder structure similar to:</p><pre class=\"ql-syntax\" spellcheck=\"false\">Zoho CRM - WorkDrive\r\n└── Leads\r\n    └── John Smith\r\n\r\n</pre><p>The corresponding <strong>WorkDrive Folder ID</strong> and <strong>WorkDrive Folder URL</strong> are then automatically updated in the CRM record. Users can simply click the WorkDrive Folder URL from the CRM record to open the associated folder directly in Zoho WorkDrive.</p><p><br></p><h3>How It Works</h3><p>The extension follows a simple automated workflow:</p><p><strong>Install Extension → Authorize Zoho WorkDrive → Create CRM Record → Automatically Create WorkDrive Folder → Update CRM with Folder ID &amp; URL → Access Folder Directly from CRM</strong></p><p>This provides a seamless connection between your customer data in Zoho CRM and your documents in Zoho WorkDrive.</p><p>Whether your team needs to manage customer documents, sales materials, account files, or deal-related documentation, <strong>Zoho WorkDrive Integration for Zoho CRM</strong> helps keep everything organized, accessible, and connected—without requiring users to manually maintain the CRM-to-WorkDrive relationship.</p>",
