    "description": "A complete activity timeline for Zoho CRM records with tracking for updates, emails, calls, notes, attachments, and field changes.",
    "longDescription": "<p>Timeline Pro for Zoho CRM Records gives your team complete visibility into everything that happens on a CRM record through a powerful, centralized timeline interface.</p><p>Zoho CRM records often contain valuable information spread across multiple sections, including emails, notes, calls, meetings, tasks, attachments, workflow executions, field updates, and automation activities. Finding and understanding the complete history of a record can be time-consuming and inefficient.</p><p>Timeline Pro solves this challenge by bringing every important activity into a single chronological timeline, allowing users to instantly understand the full lifecycle of a record without navigating between multiple CRM tabs and related lists.</p><p>The extension automatically captures and displays record activities such as emails, calls, meetings, notes, tasks, attachments, field changes, workflow executions, custom function updates, Deluge activities, CRM API actions, and other system-generated events. Every interaction is presented in a clear and organized timeline that makes it easy to review past actions and understand how a record has evolved over time.</p><p>Users can view detailed field-level change history, including previous and updated values, helping teams track important record modifications and maintain complete accountability. The timeline also identifies the source of changes, whether they were made manually by users, through workflows, custom functions, automation rules, imports, APIs, or other CRM processes.</p><p>Advanced search and filtering capabilities allow users to quickly find specific activities based on activity type, user, time period, or source. Whether you're looking for a recently uploaded document, a workflow-triggered update, a customer email, or a field modification, Timeline Pro makes it easy to locate the information you need.</p><p>Timeline Pro supports multiple Zoho CRM modules and helps sales teams, customer service representatives, managers, and CRM administrators gain complete visibility into customer interactions and record activity. By providing a single source of truth for record history, the extension improves collaboration, reduces investigation time, enhances accountability, and helps teams make better decisions based on complete historical context.</p>",
