    "description": "Automatically fill CRM address fields using Google-powered autocomplete. Save time, reduce manual entry, and ensure accurate, standardized addresses across Leads, Contacts, Accounts, and Deals.",
    "longDescription": "<p>The <strong>Google Address Auto Complete for Zoho CRM</strong> extension is designed to simplify and enhance the way users enter address information داخل Zoho CRM. By leveraging Google’s powerful location services, this extension enables users to quickly search, select, and automatically populate accurate address details directly into CRM records.</p><p>Manual address entry is time-consuming and prone to errors. This extension eliminates those challenges by providing real-time address suggestions and auto-filling relevant fields with precision—ensuring consistency and improving overall data quality.</p><h2><strong>How It Works</strong></h2><p>Once installed from the Zoho Marketplace, the extension automatically adds an <strong>“Add Google Address”</strong> button to the following modules:</p><ul><li>Leads</li><li>Contacts</li><li>Accounts</li><li>Deals</li></ul><p>With just a click, users can open a clean and intuitive popup interface where they can:</p><ol><li>Search for an address using Google’s autocomplete feature</li><li>Select the correct address from real-time suggestions</li><li>Automatically populate CRM address fields such as:</li></ol><ul><li>Street</li><li>City</li><li>State/Province</li><li>Zip/Postal Code</li><li>Country</li></ul><ol><li>Save the address directly into the CRM record</li></ol><h2><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul><li>🔍 <strong>Google-Powered Autocomplete</strong></li><li>Get accurate address suggestions instantly as you type</li><li>⚡ <strong>One-Click Address Filling</strong></li><li>Automatically populate all address fields without manual typing</li><li>📍 <strong>High Accuracy &amp; Standardization</strong></li><li>Ensure consistent and validated address data across CRM</li><li>🧩 <strong>Seamless CRM Integration</strong></li><li>Works directly inside Zoho CRM with no complex setup</li><li>🌍 <strong>Global Address Support</strong></li><li>Supports addresses worldwide using Google’s database</li><li>👥 <strong>Multi-Module Support</strong></li><li>Available in Leads, Contacts, Accounts, and Deals</li></ul><h2><strong>Benefits</strong></h2><ul><li>⏱️ <strong>Save Time</strong></li><li>Reduce address entry time from minutes to seconds</li><li>❌ <strong>Minimize Errors</strong></li><li>Avoid typos and incomplete address data</li><li>📊 <strong>Improve Data Quality</strong></li><li>Maintain clean, consistent, and reliable CRM records</li><li>🚀 <strong>Boost Productivity</strong></li><li>Allow teams to focus more on sales and customer engagement instead of manual data entry</li></ul><h2><strong>Use Cases</strong></h2><ul><li>Sales teams quickly capturing accurate customer addresses</li><li>Operations teams maintaining standardized CRM data</li><li>Businesses managing large volumes of leads and customer records</li><li>Any organization looking to improve efficiency and data accuracy in Zoho CRM</li></ul><h2><strong>Why Choose This Extension?</strong></h2><p>This extension is built specifically for Zoho CRM users who want a faster, smarter, and more reliable way to manage address data. By integrating Google’s trusted autocomplete technology directly into your workflow, it delivers both speed and accuracy—without disrupting your existing processes.</p><h2><strong>Support</strong></h2><p>For any queries or assistance, please contact:</p><p>📧 info@insyrge.com</p>",
