    "title": "Hover Integration for Zoho CRM",
    "image": {
      "url": "https://res.cloudinary.com/dwkoijsad/image/upload/v1776368973/extensions/jtbecusowpknvivggeo0.png",
      "public_id": "extensions/jtbecusowpknvivggeo0"
    },
    "description": "Take your project workflow to the next level with Hover for Zoho CRM, a powerful integration that brings the full capabilities of Hover directly into Zoho CRM. From creating jobs and capturing measurements to syncing users and managing attachments — everything can be done without leaving your CRM. Whether you manage property improvements, renovations, or field jobs, this extension simplifies your processes, improves data accuracy, and saves you hours of manual work.",
    "longDescription": "<p><strong style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(10, 209, 176);\">Hover for Zoho CRM: Seamless Job &amp; User Management Inside Your CRM</strong></p><p>Take your project workflow to the next level with Hover for Zoho CRM, a powerful integration that brings the full capabilities of Hover directly into Zoho CRM. From creating jobs and capturing measurements to syncing users and managing attachments — everything can be done without leaving your CRM.</p><p>Whether you manage property improvements, renovations, or field jobs, this extension simplifies your processes, improves data accuracy, and saves you hours of manual work.</p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(10, 209, 176);\">Why Choose Hover for Zoho CRM?</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">This integration is built to eliminate double data entry, centralize job information, and ensure your team always has the latest project details at their fingertips. With real-time sync, intuitive widgets, and automated workflows, you can manage every stage of a job — right inside Zoho CRM.</span></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(10, 209, 176);\">Key Features</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(10, 209, 176);\">1. Automated User &amp; Job Sync</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">User Sync – Sync all Hover users into Zoho CRM automatically on connection, with weekly scheduled updates.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Job Sync – Import all jobs upon first connection and keep them updated weekly through the scheduler.</span></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(10, 209, 176);\">2. Powerful Job Management from a Widget</strong></p><p>Access the Hover Widget directly from the Deals module to:</p><p>Create new jobs instantly.</p><p>Send capture requests for field measurements.</p><p>Edit existing jobs on the fly.</p><p>Request and download job images, attaching them directly to Deals and Job records.</p><p>Request multiple measurement types and store them as attachments in Zoho CRM.</p><p>Delete jobs from both Hover and Zoho CRM simultaneously.</p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(10, 209, 176);\">3. Smart Connection &amp; Webhook Automation</strong></p><p>Automatically create and verify webhooks when authorizing the connection.</p><p>Fetch and store your Hover organization’s details instantly.</p><p>Receive real-time updates in Zoho CRM whenever changes occur in Hover.</p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(10, 209, 176);\">4. Workflows that Keep You in Control</strong></p><p>Automatically update Hover jobs when changes are made in Zoho CRM.</p><p>Assign jobs to different users effortlessly with automated workflows.</p><p>Benefits at a Glance</p><p>Save Time – Automates user and job syncing, reducing manual work.</p><p>Centralize Data – Store all job-related files, measurements, and images directly in CRM records.</p><p>Stay Updated – Real-time sync ensures you always work with the latest information.</p><p>Work Faster – Manage jobs without switching between Hover and Zoho CRM.</p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(10, 209, 176);\">Who Should Use Hover for Zoho CRM?</strong></p><p>Ideal for:</p><p>Roofing, renovation, and construction companies.</p><p>Businesses using Hover for field measurements and project data.</p><p>Teams that want accurate, up-to-date job details directly inside Zoho CRM.</p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(10, 209, 176);\">Get Started Today!</strong></p><p>Stop juggling between multiple platforms — bring Hover’s power straight into Zoho CRM and streamline your entire project workflow.</p><p>Install Hover for Zoho CRM from Zoho Marketplace and start working smarter, not harder.</p>",
    "link": "https://marketplace.zoho.com/app/crm/hover-integration-for-zoho-crm",
